 the occurrence rewrite.\n\nOverall sign-off: **the occurrence-model architecture is signed off; the stack document is signed off as written, and the register document is signed off subject to the non-blocking stale-section correction above.** The separate `yin.vm.engine.md` finding remains unchanged and outside this ruling."}}
